<p class="is-style-ucsc-intro-text has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="line-height:1.8">UC Santa Cruz just launched a redesigned news site and some links may have broken in this transition. Sorry for the inconvenience. Please feel free to let us know by emailing <a href="mailto:communications@ucsc.edu" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">communications@ucsc.edu</a> and we&#8217;ll try to fix it as soon as possible.</p>


